<http://purl.org/co/List> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty>.
<http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> """
Ontology for healthcare metadata - especially metadata found in DICOM files 
(Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine, see http://dicom.nema.org/).

Author: Michael Brunnbauer, Bonubase GmbH (www.bonubase.com).
The author's email address is brunni@netestate.de.

See http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1help for explanations.
""";
                                     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/issued> "2013-04-29"^^xsd:date;
                                     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2013-07-06"^^xsd:date;
                                     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Healthcare metadata / DICOM ontology";
                                     <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix> "dicom";
                                     <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespaceUri> "http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1#";
                                     a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>;
                                     rdfs:comment """
Ontology for healthcare metadata - especially metadata found in DICOM files 
(Digital Imaging and Communications in Medicine, see http://dicom.nema.org/).

Author: Michael Brunnbauer, Bonubase GmbH (www.bonubase.com).
The author's email address is brunni@netestate.de.

See http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1help for explanations.
""";
                                     rdfs:label "Healthcare metadata / DICOM ontology".
dicom:ALinePixelSpacing a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                        rdfs:domain dicom:IE.Image;
                        rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1>;
                        rdfs:label "A-line Pixel Spacing";
                        rdfs:range xsd:double;
                        <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentProperty> dicom:Tag.0052.0014.
dicom:ALineRate a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                rdfs:domain dicom:IE.Image;
                rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1>;
                rdfs:label "A-line Rate";
                rdfs:range xsd:double;
                <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#equivalentProperty> dicom:Tag.0052.0011.
dicom:ALinesPerFrame a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
                     rdfs:domain dicom:IE.Image;
                     rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.org/healthcarevocab/v1>;
